n**Final Answer:** Each of them gets \\boxed{5} dollars.", "pred_ans": "5", "wrap_que": "Solve this math problem step by step. You MUST put your final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: While walking down the street with his 3 younger siblings, Greg found $20. To be fair to his siblings, he decided to split the money equally. How much money did each of them get?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
