uare feet in Brittany's comforter is \\(\\boxed{68}\\).", "pred_ans": "68", "wrap_que": "Solve this math problem step by step. You MUST put your final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: Brittany's quilted comforter has many 1-foot by 1-foot colored squares. The comforter had 14 red squares, 4 more blue squares than red squares, 6 more green squares than blue squares, and 12 fewer white squares than green squares.  How many square feet is Brittany's comforter?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
