swer:**\n\n\\boxed{9\\text{ minutes}}", "pred_ans": "9", "wrap_que": "Solve this math problem step by step. You MUST put your final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: Carrie is planning the caroling schedule. The choir plans to sing \"Deck the Halls\" twice and \"Jingle Bells\" once. If \"Deck the Halls\" is 150 seconds long and \"Jingle Bells\" is 240 seconds long, how long will they be caroling?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
