inal answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: James decides to pick some blueberries.  It cost $20 to go picking and then another $1.5 per pound.  He picked 30 pounds of blueberries.  How much did he save compared to buying at the store for $2.5 a pound?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
