' total cost:\n\\[\n95,060 - 29,100 = 65,960 \\text{ dollars}\n\\]\n\nThus, the extra cost to repave Lewis' street is \\boxed{65960} dollars.", "pred_ans": "65960", "wrap_que": "Solve this math problem step by step. You MUST put your final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: It costs $194 per meter to repave a street. Monica's street is 150 meters long. How much more does it cost to repave Lewis' street, which is 490 meters long?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
