r final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: The caretaker of the docks needs to buy some new line. He wants 3 feet of line for every foot of dock. Right now, there is 200 feet of dock, and he has 6 feet of new line. How many feet of line does he need to buy in total?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
