ms} = 175 + 140 + 280 = 695\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\boxed{695}", "pred_ans": "695", "wrap_que": "Solve this math problem step by step. You MUST put your final answer in \\boxed{}. Problem: A treasure hunter found a buried treasure chest filled with gems. There were 175 diamonds, 35 fewer rubies than diamonds, and twice the number of emeralds than the rubies.   How many of the gems were there in the chest?\n Solution:\n<think>\n"}
